  "instructions": [
    "In a large cazuela, heat 1 tablespoon of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the grated carrot and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the haddock, speculaas spice mix, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in the yogurt and water, and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 8-10 minutes, or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and dill, and serve hot, garnished with lemon wedges.",
    "Serve immediately, and enjoy!"
